      "widgets_values": [
        "# VSCS Phase 20.18.2.2f — Candidate A Manual Bench\nClean Benchmark Prompt\n\nThis workflow removes the VSCS Production Package loader and continuity/prompt-governance nodes.\nEdit the positive/negative CLIP text nodes directly and choose the three reference images manually.\n\nControlled settings:\n- LTX-2.3 distilled 1.1\n- 1280×720\n- 145 provider frames / 144 saved governed frames\n- 24 fps\n- fixed manual seed 2360325115660865 (JavaScript-safe)\n- group / Xorix / bridge guide strengths: 0.90 / 0.25 / 0.25\n- frame_idx = -1 for all three reference guides"
      ]
    },
    {
