      "title": "Benchmark Prompt",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.14.1",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Clean benchmark prompt\nWide static shot inside the Iron Horizon bridge. Only two people are present anywhere in frame: Captain Sandra Crawford at her control station and Commander James Spence several metres away, facing the forward display. Every other bridge station is empty and no background crew are present. Xorix is clearly visible on the forward display. Sandra studies her instruments, notices an unusual reading, pauses, then raises her eyes and turns her head toward James. James remains still and continues looking at the forward display. Sandra does not speak. The camera remains completely static throughout the shot.\n\n## Clean benchmark negative\nextra people, background crew, third person, additional officers, duplicate people, duplicated character, identity swap, merged identity, changing faces, changing uniforms, scene cut, camera movement, close-up, insert shot, split screen, contact sheet, generated speech, dialogue, reference sheet composition\n\nFor a controlled comparison, change only the two CLIPTextEncode text boxes. Keep seed, model, references, strengths, resolution, frame count and FPS unchanged."
      ]
    },
